               <text>
                  <paragraph>cellulose acetate, corn starch, crospovidone, D&amp;C red no. 7 calcium lake, dextrose excipient, FD&amp;C blue no. 1 aluminum lake, FD&amp;C red no. 40 aluminum lake, flavors, gum arabic, hydroxypropyl cellulose, hypromellose, lactose monohydrate, magnesium stearate, maltodextrin, mineral oil*, modified starch, sucralose</paragraph>
                  <paragraph>*may contain mineral oil</paragraph>
               </text>
               <effectiveTime value="20210120"/>
            </section>
         </component>
